program	conformance/N11_align_refuses_frame_resident_local.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	`@align` is not supported on `scratch`: it lives in this function's coroutine frame, not on the stack, and a frame field cannot carry an alignment yet — move the aligned buffer into a `sync` helper that does not suspend, or hold it in an `@align`ed `static`
